 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "The prostration is never drawn and its chapter is geometric (no dawn). It is framed at once by Al-Muyassar: «تحية وتكريمًا، لا عبادة وخضوعًا، وكان ذلك جائزًا في شريعتهم». «العرش» is the king's seat (both tafsirs): no plate. Nothing for Satan (100:30-37, not glossed). Geometric only from «إن ربي لطيف لما يشاء». Yusuf's prayer (101): no plate. The cover is the plate-free light frame of 101 (a star under «تحقق الرؤيا» could read as the dream's stars). 101:18-19 keeps As-Sa'di's «ولم يكن هذا دعاء باستعجال الموت»."
 },
